{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RdkJ8BopnZaQ6FDTuMLSA4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Trauma Center Under the Knife Second Opinion instruments forceps scalpel suture drain ultrasound laser syringe antibiotic gel score COOL GOOD BAD rank nurse Angie operation failed vitals\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Under the Knife | |\",\"url\":\"https://atlus.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Under_the_Knife?oldid=3738\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-235540/\"},{\"title\":\"cosimoquiche.github.io\",\"url\":\"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html\"},{\"title\":\"Passer au contenu\",\"url\":\"https://www.journaldugeek.com/test/trauma-center-nintendo-ds/\"},{\"title\":\"www.nintendolife.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.nintendolife.com/games/wii/trauma_center_second_opinion/reviews\"},{\"title\":\"trauma center under the knife review\",\"url\":\"https://gamesfirst.com/articles/2005/trauma-center-under-the-knife-review/\"},{\"title\":\"www.giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://Www.Giantbomb.com/trauma-center-under-the-knife/3030-18208/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Under the Knife\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Trauma_Center_Under_the_Knife\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/25357/-/adblurbs/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Under the Knife\",\"url\":\"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-18208\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.1209k.com/content/wikipedia_en_simple_all_maxi_2024-06/A/Trauma_Center%3A_Second_Opinion\"},{\"title\":\"🕹️ Pre-orders now open for physical editions of MMPR: Rita's Rewind\",\"url\":\"https://mobygames.com/game/25357/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"gamespot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-under-the-knife/user-reviews/2200-436256/\"},{\"title\":\"www.cdgr.ucsb.edu\",\"url\":\"https://www.cdgr.ucsb.edu/database/game/520\"},{\"title\":\"Follow TV Tropes\",\"url\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Characters/TraumaCenterAtlus\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Under the Knife\",\"url\":\"https://gopherproxy.meulie.net/tilde.pink/0/~bencollver/gamefaqs/text/ds/trauma-center-under-the-knife/trauma-center-under-the-knife-faqs-42179.txt\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Second Opinion - HomePage Media\",\"url\":\"https://my.homepage.net/news/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Series\",\"url\":\"https://traumacentergame.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center_Series\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center (series)\",\"url\":\"https://AllTheTropes.org/wiki/Trauma_Team\"},{\"title\":\"Healing Touch\",\"url\":\"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/general/Healing_Touch.html\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up the specific details you asked about. Nothing I found covers the instrument list, the COOL/GOOD/BAD rating labels, or what happens when an operation fails. What I did find is general background on the game.\n\n- **Game identity:** Second Opinion is a Wii remake of the 2005 DS game Under the Knife, which is the original with its title shown as Trauma Center: Under the Knife. It is the second release in the Trauma Center series, being a Wii remake of the first title.\n- **Gameplay:** Players must perform operations on patients before their vitals reach zero. On the DS original, the player uses the touch screen to select medical instruments and carry out the required actions.\n- **Ranking:** The remake introduces the famous XS rank. A user-written S-rank guide exists for the original, with updated cutoff scores for several missions, but the snippet doesn't include the cutoffs themselves.\n- **Nurse Angie:** Angie Thompson is an elite nurse with an International Nursing License who transferred to Hope Hospital and became Derek's assistant.\n\nFor the instrument list and the COOL/GOOD/BAD thresholds, the cosimoquiche tc-wiki (https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html) and the Trauma Center fandom wiki are the most likely places to find them. I'd check those directly, since I didn't open them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41ecbf1a-95aa-45b3-a227-3833f8bfa7e2","uuid":"2111377e-4b96-4cfb-942e-da9df60ab788","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:27:08.880Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Trauma Center Under the Knife Second Opinion instruments forceps scalpel suture drain ultrasound laser syringe antibiotic gel score COOL GOOD BAD rank nurse Angie operation failed vitals","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01VDSnzVwtBUwX6fNBK4gZx4","content":[{"title":"Trauma Center: Under the Knife | |","url":"https://atlus.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Under_the_Knife?oldid=3738"},{"title":"gamespot.com","url":"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-second-opinion/user-reviews/2200-235540/"},{"title":"cosimoquiche.github.io","url":"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html"},{"title":"Passer au contenu","url":"https://www.journaldugeek.com/test/trauma-center-nintendo-ds/"},{"title":"www.nintendolife.com","url":"https://www.nintendolife.com/games/wii/trauma_center_second_opinion/reviews"},{"title":"trauma center under the knife review","url":"https://gamesfirst.com/articles/2005/trauma-center-under-the-knife-review/"},{"title":"www.giantbomb.com","url":"https://Www.Giantbomb.com/trauma-center-under-the-knife/3030-18208/"},{"title":"Trauma Center Under the Knife","url":"https://giantbomb.com/wiki/Games/Trauma_Center_Under_the_Knife"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Second Opinion","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/25357/-/adblurbs/"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Under the Knife","url":"https://www.giantbomb.com/wd/3030-18208"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Second Opinion","url":"https://wiki.1209k.com/content/wikipedia_en_simple_all_maxi_2024-06/A/Trauma_Center%3A_Second_Opinion"},{"title":"🕹️ Pre-orders now open for physical editions of MMPR: Rita's Rewind","url":"https://mobygames.com/game/25357/trauma-center-second-opinion"},{"title":"gamespot.com","url":"https://www.gamespot.com/trauma-center-under-the-knife/user-reviews/2200-436256/"},{"title":"www.cdgr.ucsb.edu","url":"https://www.cdgr.ucsb.edu/database/game/520"},{"title":"Follow TV Tropes","url":"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Characters/TraumaCenterAtlus"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Under the Knife","url":"https://gopherproxy.meulie.net/tilde.pink/0/~bencollver/gamefaqs/text/ds/trauma-center-under-the-knife/trauma-center-under-the-knife-faqs-42179.txt"},{"title":"Trauma Center Second Opinion - HomePage Media","url":"https://my.homepage.net/news/trauma-center-second-opinion"},{"title":"Trauma Center Series","url":"https://traumacentergame.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center_Series"},{"title":"Trauma Center (series)","url":"https://AllTheTropes.org/wiki/Trauma_Team"},{"title":"Healing Touch","url":"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/general/Healing_Touch.html"}]},"The search didn't turn up the specific details you asked about. Nothing I found covers the instrument list, the COOL/GOOD/BAD rating labels, or what happens when an operation fails. What I did find is general background on the game.\n\n- **Game identity:** Second Opinion is a Wii remake of the 2005 DS game Under the Knife, which is the original with its title shown as Trauma Center: Under the Knife. It is the second release in the Trauma Center series, being a Wii remake of the first title.\n- **Gameplay:** Players must perform operations on patients before their vitals reach zero. On the DS original, the player uses the touch screen to select medical instruments and carry out the required actions.\n- **Ranking:** The remake introduces the famous XS rank. A user-written S-rank guide exists for the original, with updated cutoff scores for several missions, but the snippet doesn't include the cutoffs themselves.\n- **Nurse Angie:** Angie Thompson is an elite nurse with an International Nursing License who transferred to Hope Hospital and became Derek's assistant.\n\nFor the instrument list and the COOL/GOOD/BAD thresholds, the cosimoquiche tc-wiki (https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html) and the Trauma Center fandom wiki are the most likely places to find them. I'd check those directly, since I didn't open them."],"durationSeconds":6.256876376,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RdkJ8BopnZaQ6FDTuMLSA4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HkbtKfjkvJQ3qPbc1xe8gX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Trauma Center Second Opinion Naomi Kimishima Healing Touch vitals stop chapter 6 story GUILT strains Kyriaki Savato Caduceus Delphi plot summary\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Second_Opinion\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2040\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update 36\"},{\"title\":\"cosimoquiche.github.io\",\"url\":\"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2021\"},{\"title\":\"Follow TV Tropes\",\"url\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Characters/TraumaCenterAtlus\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Team\",\"url\":\"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Trauma_Team\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2015\"},{\"title\":\"giantbomb.com\",\"url\":\"https://giantbomb.com/nozomi-weaver/3005-9921/\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion Timeline ( Real )\",\"url\":\"https://fanabyss.com/timeline/by-tag/503\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center Series\",\"url\":\"https://traumacentergame.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center_Series\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\",\"url\":\"https://www.animeclick.it/game/22074/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center (series)\",\"url\":\"https://AllTheTropes.org/wiki/Trauma_Team\"},{\"title\":\"tvtropes.org\",\"url\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Headscratchers/TraumaCenterAtlus\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-New-Blood/Update 06\"},{\"title\":\"trauma center second opinion\",\"url\":\"https://mundogamer.community/pt-BR/game/trauma-center-second-opinion\"},{\"title\":\"Your Reading List\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update 13\"},{\"title\":\"The Let's Play Archive\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Team/Update%2056\"},{\"title\":\"Trauma Center New Blood\",\"url\":\"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-New-Blood\"}]\n\nThe search confirmed the general setup but did not return a clear account of the chapter 6 \"vitals stop\" scene or the GUILT strains plot, so I can't verify those details.\n\n- **Basics:** The second entry in the Trauma Center series, Second Opinion is a remake of the Nintendo DS title Trauma Center: Under the Knife. The Japanese title is Caduceus Z, and the game is a Wii remake of the first title.\n- **Naomi and Healing Touch:** The new narrative first follows Naomi Kimishima, living under the alias \"Nozomi Weaver,\" a surgeon ostracized due to her Healing Touch. She was forced to enter witness protection and hide her true identity. She returned to her original name at the conclusion of Second Opinion.\n- **Chapter 6 and GUILT:** A fan-wiki source says Derek gets infected with GUILT in the fourth mission of the sixth chapter and his life is in danger, and Dr Nozomi Weaver/Naomi Kimishima has to save his life. This is the only source I found on that event, and it is a TV Tropes entry, so treat it as secondary.\n- **Kyriaki:** A Let's Play walkthrough lists Operation 2, with Dr. Kimishima, is Kyriaki. It does not describe the operation's plot significance.\n- **Delphi:** Stiles eventually confronts the core members of Delphi, including Angie's father, Kenneth Blackwell, who was coerced into joining the group. The sentence is cut off in the source.\n\nFor a full plot summary or the specific vitals-stop scene, a detailed walkthrough such as the Let's Play Archive entries for chapters 6–7 or the game's wiki would be the next place to check.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41ecbf1a-95aa-45b3-a227-3833f8bfa7e2","uuid":"f0627306-de09-4df1-beb1-782ba48f50dc","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:27:09.319Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Trauma Center Second Opinion Naomi Kimishima Healing Touch vitals stop chapter 6 story GUILT strains Kyriaki Savato Caduceus Delphi plot summary","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018SmoN3LQewJUGwbkQ7NvaV","content":[{"title":"Trauma Center: Second Opinion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Second_Opinion"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2040"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update 36"},{"title":"cosimoquiche.github.io","url":"https://cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki/games/so/SO.html"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2021"},{"title":"Follow TV Tropes","url":"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Characters/TraumaCenterAtlus"},{"title":"Trauma Team","url":"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/Trauma_Team"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion/Update%2015"},{"title":"giantbomb.com","url":"https://giantbomb.com/nozomi-weaver/3005-9921/"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Second Opinion Timeline ( Real )","url":"https://fanabyss.com/timeline/by-tag/503"},{"title":"Trauma Center Series","url":"https://traumacentergame.fandom.com/wiki/Trauma_Center_Series"},{"title":"Trauma Center: Second Opinion","url":"https://www.animeclick.it/game/22074/trauma-center-second-opinion"},{"title":"Trauma Center (series)","url":"https://AllTheTropes.org/wiki/Trauma_Team"},{"title":"tvtropes.org","url":"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Headscratchers/TraumaCenterAtlus"},{"title":"The Let's Play Archive","url":"https://lparchive.org/Tr