r scorch that grows and fades over its life, as bursts do.\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:17: * 1,024 glows (sprites, in pages of 1,024), 1,024 decals, 32 ribbons, so a frame costs at most 7 draw calls and\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:46:import { createDecals } from './decals';\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:63:import { createRibbons, type TrailSampleLike } from './ribbons';\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:67:import { createSprites, STREAK } from './sprites';\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:70:export const FX_BUDGET = { particles: 4096, glows: 1024, decals: 1024, ribbons: 32, boltLights: 4 } as const;\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:88:  sprites: number;\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:89:  decals: number;\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:90:  ribbons: number;\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:91:  /** Sprites, decals and ribbons left out this frame: over their budgets. */\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:127:  /** Draws a ribbon along `samples` (oldest first, an animator's trail) this frame, in `tint` (hex). */\nengine/gfx/fx/effects.ts:129:  /** Lays a floor decal at `at` growing and fading over its life: a ring, or a disc (a scorch) when its width \n....\ntools/templates/emitter/template.json:2:  \"describe\": \"An emitter: a particle effect as data (how its particles start, move and look; its burst, the event types it answers, its rate and light), with a unit test that its event bursts its particles within budget (PLAN.md WP 6.4).\",\ntools/templates/emitter/template.json:3:  \"id\": \"the module's path, labs/<lab>/emitters/<name> (its id is emitter:<name>): labs/box/emitters/spores\",\ntools/templates/emitter/emitter.ts.tmpl:2: * @file The emitter `emitter:{{name}}`: what it is (replace this text; `x docs` puts the first sentence in INDEX).\ntools/templates/emitter/emitter.ts.tmpl:12:import { defineEmitter } from '../../../engine';\ntools/templates/emitter/emitter.ts.tmpl:14:/** The emitter `emitter:{{name}}`: replace this sentence with what it is. */\ntools/templates/emitter/emitter.ts.tmpl:15:export const {{name}} = 